  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n\n<p><script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script></p>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css\">\n\n<!-- STRUCTURED DATA (SCHEMA) -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n      \"itemListElement\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 1,\n          \"name\": \"Home\",\n          \"item\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 2,\n          \"name\": \"AC Services\",\n          \"item\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-services\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 3,\n          \"name\": \"AC Installation Surat\",\n          \"item\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-installation-surat\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Service\",\n      \"name\": \"Professional and Standard AC Installation in Surat\",\n      \"description\": \"Expert AC mounting, technical vacuuming, and energy-efficient commissioning for residential and industrial units in Surat City, Hazira, and Sachin GIDC.\",\n      \"serviceType\": \"HVAC Installation\",\n      \"provider\": {\n        \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n        \"name\": \"Atlas Aircon\",\n        \"image\": \"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Split-Ac-Installation-and-Repair-Service-1.webp\",\n        \"telePhone\": \"+919727257141\",\n        \"priceRange\": \"INR\",\n        \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Surat\",\n          \"addressRegion\": \"Gujarat\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"IN\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n\n<p><style>\n    :root { --primary: #004aad; --secondary: #00a8e8; --accent: #f8fafc; }\n    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; scroll-behavior: smooth; color: #334155; }\n    .hero-gradient { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #004aad 0%, #002d6b 100%); }\n    .glass-effect { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }\n    .product-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); transition: all 0.3s ease; box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1); }\n</style></p>\n\n<!-- BREADCRUMB -->\n<nav class=\"bg-gray-100 py-3 px-4 border-b\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-xs md:text-sm flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-500\">\n        <a href=\"/\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Home</a> <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right text-[10px]\"></i>\n        <a href=\"/ac-services\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">AC Services</a> <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right text-[10px]\"></i>\n        <span class=\"text-gray-900 font-semibold\">AC Installation Surat</span>\n    </div>\n</nav>\n\n<!-- HERO SECTION -->\n<header class=\"hero-gradient text-white py-24 px-4 relative overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 opacity-10 -mr-20 -mt-20\">\n        <svg width=\"400\" height=\"400\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\"><path d=\"M12,2L4.5,20.29L5.21,21L12,18L18.79,21L19.5,20.29L12,2Z\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10\">\n        <span class=\"bg-blue-500/30 text-blue-100 px-6 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 inline-block italic\">Surat&#8217;s Premier HVAC Engineering Specialist</span>\n        <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-7xl font-black mb-6 leading-tight\">Professional and Standard AC Installation in Surat</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-100 mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed\">Advanced 7-step AC commissioning for the Diamond City. Precision mounting and 500-micron vacuuming for Adajan homes and Hazira industrial complexes.</p>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\">\n            <a class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg shadow-xl transition-all flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> \n                <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp text-2xl\"></i> Chat for Quote\n            </a> \n            <a class=\"bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/30 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg transition-all\" href=\"#technical\">Technical Workflow</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- THE ATLAS DIFFERENCE -->\n<section id=\"technical\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-10 h-10 text-blue-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"></path></svg>\n                    Technical AC Setup for Surat&#8217;s Coastal Climate\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">In Surat, high humidity and coastal salt air can lead to rapid coil corrosion if the installation isn&#8217;t technically sound. A standard &#8220;local&#8221; setup often fails to address these regional challenges. Most premium residential towers in Vesu and Adajan trust professional <a href=\"/ac-repair-surat\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold underline\">AC Repair in Surat</a> specialists for new setup. At Atlas Aircon, we follow a <strong>7-Step Precision Protocol</strong> to ensure 100% cooling efficiency and protection against coastal atmospheric stress.</p>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                        <div><strong>Nitrogen Leak Testing:</strong> Joints tested at high PSI to ensure a permanent, leak-proof <a href=\"/gas-charging-service/\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium hover:underline\">Gas Charging Service</a>.</div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                        <div><strong>500-Micron Vacuuming:</strong> Deep dehydration using industrial pumps to remove moisture—critical for Surat&#8217;s humid environment to prevent compressor failure.</div>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-start bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"></path></svg>\n                        <div><strong>Safety-Matched Wiring:</strong> Utilizing high-grade <a href=\"/copper-wire/\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium hover:underline\">copper wiring</a> to prevent electrical degradation in saline air conditions.</div>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative group\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 400\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-3xl shadow-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100\">\n                    <rect width=\"500\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"180\" r=\"120\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"80\" width=\"300\" height=\"80\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#004aad\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n                    <rect x=\"120\" y=\"145\" width=\"260\" height=\"5\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n                    <rect x=\"320\" y=\"240\" width=\"120\" height=\"100\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#334155\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"290\" r=\"30\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M300 120 L350 120 L350 240\" stroke=\"#00a8e8\" stroke-width=\"8\" fill=\"none\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M150 350 Q150 250 200 250 T250 350\" fill=\"#002d6b\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"220\" r=\"25\" fill=\"#002d6b\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity bg-blue-900/10 rounded-3xl\">\n                     <span class=\"bg-white text-blue-900 px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg\">Surat Technical Standard</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- WOOCOMMERCE STYLE PRODUCTS SECTION -->\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 italic\">Essential Spares &#038; Installation Materials</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-16\">High-grade WooCommerce components optimized for Surat&#8217;s coastal climate.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6\">\n            <a href=\"/remote/\" class=\"product-card bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col items-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-blue-600\"><i c