=\"mb-6 text-gray-600 text-sm\">Industrial-grade components for <a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-surat\" class=\"text-blue-700 font-medium\">ducting repairs</a> and new split setups.</p>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3 mb-6 text-sm\">\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\"><span>Professional Mounting</span> <strong>Fixed Rate</strong></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\"><span>Extra <a href=\"/copper-pipe/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Copper Pipe</a></span> <strong>Standard Cost</strong></li>\n                    <li class=\"flex justify-between border-b pb-2\"><span>Heavy Duty <a href=\"/outdoor-stand/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">MS Stand</a></span> <strong>Standard Rate</strong></li>\n                </ul>\n                <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"block w-full text-center bg-blue-600 text-white py-3 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg transform transition hover:-translate-y-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get Instant Surat Quote</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- LOCAL REACH - SURAT SERVICE AREAS -->\n<section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-100\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center text-white\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-16 italic text-gray-900\">Serving the Diamond City of Surat</h2>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 text-left text-white\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-800 border-b pb-4\">Residential Areas</h3>\n                <div class=\"h-64 overflow-y-auto text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 pr-4 space-y-2\">\n                    Adajan, Vesu, Piplod, Varachha Road, Katargam, City Light Area, Althan, Bhatar Road, Pal, Rander Road, Udhna, Limbayat, Mahidharpura, Nanpura, Ring Road Area, Ghod Dod Road, New City Light, Sarthana, Parvat Patiya, Amroli.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-800 border-b pb-4\">Industrial Zones</h3>\n                <div class=\"h-64 overflow-y-auto text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 pr-4 space-y-2\">\n                    Hazira Industrial Hub, Sachin GIDC, Pandesara Industrial Estate, Ichchhapore GIDC, Olpad Industrial Belt, Udhna GIDC, Kim Industrial Area, Palsana.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FAQ SECTION - 10 QUESTIONS -->\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 italic text-gray-900 text-center\">10 Critical AC Installation FAQs for Surat</h2>\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <!-- FAQ 1 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\" open>\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Why is proper vacuuming critical for new ACs in Surat?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Surat&#8217;s coastal air is highly humid. Failing to vacuum the pipes during installation traps moisture, which reacts with refrigerant to form acid. This acid destroys the compressor internally. Our <a href=\"/ac-service-surat\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Surat AC service</a> ensures technical 500-micron vacuuming for every unit.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 2 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    How long does a professional split AC setup take?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">A professional technical installation in Surat typically takes 2.5 to 3 hours, allowing for safe mounting, leak testing, and vacuuming.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 3 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Do you provide industrial HVAC installation for Hazira factories?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes, we specialize in high-capacity <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-surat\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">Central AC installations</a> for industrial plants and corporate offices in Hazira and Sachin GIDC.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 4 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    What is the ideal mounting height for the indoor unit?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Ideally, 7.5 to 8 feet from the floor for best air rotation and ease of future <a href=\"/ac-repair-surat\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold underline\">repair</a> access.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 5 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Do you offer a workmanship warranty?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes, Atlas Aircon provides a 30-day installation guarantee for every job in Surat. If any leak occurs, we fix it free.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 6 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Can I reuse copper pipes from my old R22 unit for a new Inverter AC?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">We strongly recommend new <a href=\"/copper-pipe/\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">copper piping</a> because old pipes may contain residual oil incompatible with R32 gas, leading to compressor burnout.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 7 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Is a heavy-duty MS stand necessary for outdoor units in high-rises?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes. A heavy-duty <a href=\"/outdoor-stand/\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\">outdoor stand</a> ensures safety against high coastal winds and reduces unit vibration in balconies.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 8 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    Do you repair commercial deep freezers in Surat?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Yes, our mobile teams handle commercial <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-surat\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline text-blue-500\">deep freezer repair</a> and industrial maintenance across Surat.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 9 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    What electrical wiring is required for a 2 Ton AC?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">A dedicated 20A socket and 4.0 sq mm <a href=\"/copper-wire/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\">multi-strand wire</a> are essential to handle the load without heating.</p>\n            </details>\n            <!-- FAQ 10 -->\n            <details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\n                <summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                    How often should I service my AC in Surat&#8217;s dust?\n                    <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span>\n                </summary>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm text-blue-500\">Due to textile dust and humidity, we recommend a professional <a href=\"/ac-service-surat\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline font-semibold\">service</a> every 4 months to maintain efficiency.</p>\n            </details>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\n<section class=\"py-24 px-4 hero-gradient text-white text-center\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-white\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6 text-white\">Ready for 10/10 Cooling in Surat?</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10 text-white\">Experience the difference of technical precision. Trust the Diamond City&#8217;s HVAC engineering experts for your home or business.</p>\n        <a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-blue-900 px-12 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transform hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-2xl\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\">\n            <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2\"></i> Book Surat Installation Now\n        </a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n",
